>Goosebumpse</b> to <b>Chainsaw Massacre</b><br /> \u2022 16:00 - Rebel against your Family in Curseborne (if you want to)!<br /> \u2022 20:00 \u2013 Different levels of horror and the Curse in Curseborne<br /> \u2022 21:30 \u2013 <b>Scooby-Doo</b> as an inspiration for the system \ud83d\ude0a<br /> \u2022 24:00 \u2013 <b>The Runaways</b> series, or comic book teenagers running away from their super evil parents<br /> \u2022 25:00 \u2013 All the inspirations from <b>Buffy</b> \u2013 and who would be which Lineage from the cast \ud83d\ude0a<br /> \u2022 31:30 \u2013 ANIMORPHY as an inspiration <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> \u2022 32:50 \u2013<b> Buff</b>y Part 2 <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> \u2022 37:00 \u2013 <b>The Bear</b> series about a Chicago cooking family under the Curse \u2013 and the difficult relationships in it<br /> \u2022 39:30 \u2013 The <b>Supranatural</b> series, but only the first 5 seasons \ud83d\ude09 Devs points out that there are supposedly no Hunters as Lineage in the game \u2013 but the themes of the physical and found family resonate great in this series. (P.S. On the Onyx Path forum we are already making Hunters fan-made \u2013 there is also a link to the topic about it in the comment <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 09-20-2024, 03:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6